      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 4,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Verily, there is one favor I would ask. 'Tis\r\nnot a difficult matter... I only need you\r\nto slay some monsters.",
        "Jp" : "実は１つ、頼みごとを聞いてもらいたくてな\r\nなに、そんなに難しい話じゃない\r\n魔物を退治してきてほしいだけだ"
