      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 5,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "The other day, when I tried to go to\r\n<SPOT 946>, where I always fish... I\r\nsaw aught like a shadow, flitting about.",
        "Jp" : "この間、俺がいつも釣りをする《<SPOT 946>》に\r\n行こうとしたら、影みたいなものがサーッと\r\n飛び回るのが見えたんだ"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 544758,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 6,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "I turned back at once, so... I wit not what that\r\ntruly was— Mayhap 'twas some manner of monster...\r\nNay... 'tis a monster, beyond doubt!",
        "Jp" : "すぐに引き返したから\r\n実際にアレが何だったのかはわからんが――\r\n多分、魔物の類だろう\r\nいや、間違いなく魔物だろう！"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 544759,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
